      "widgets_values": [
        "OmniCam -> MiniMax H3 (reference_video)\n\nThe playblast is the motion reference. Author the shot in the\nDirector, queue, then:\n\n  h3_api    -> Monitor.reference_video into\n               MinimaxHailuo03ReferenceNode.reference_video\n  h3_native -> Monitor.reference_frames into\n               MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo.ref_videos\n\nUse Monitor.final_prompt as the text prompt: it already says to copy\nthe camera motion and not the proxy's appearance.\n\nThe API path enforces the documented reference limits (23.9-60.5 fps,\n2-15s). Unlike the track profiles, a multi-shot edit is fine here --\nthe video carries the cuts, and the prompt becomes neutral."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
